<%- include('partials/header', { pageTitle: 'Menopause Forecast — e-healthwatch', pageDesc: 'Based on your details, this calculator has nothing forward-looking to offer right now.' }) %>

<div class="dash-bg">

  <section id="banner-section">
    <div class="container-fluid">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="banner-placeholder text-center">
          <h2>Menopause Forecasting</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="dash-body" style="max-width:600px;text-align:center;padding-top:48px;">

    <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:40px 32px;box-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);">
      <div style="font-size:48px;margin-bottom:16px;">🌸</div>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--stone-dark);">We can't give you a forecast right now</h2>

      <p style="color:var(--stone);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:left;">
        Based on the details you've shared, this calculator isn't able to give you a meaningful forecast right now — your results suggest menopause may already be underway rather than pointing to a future date.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--stone);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:28px;text-align:left;">
        This isn't a diagnosis, just a signal from the numbers — we'd recommend speaking with a gynaecologist directly for a full assessment.
      </p>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/contact.asp" class="auth-submit" style="display:inline-flex;width:auto;">
          Contact our doctor team →
        </a>
        <a href="/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid var(--stone-200);border-radius:8px;color:var(--stone);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;">
          Back to home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
